wireguard-mc
============

This package provides a customized wireguard-go that speaks WireGuard over
TCP with optional Minecraft protocol camouflage. Both tunnel ends must use
this binary (not kernel WireGuard / stock UDP wireguard-go).

Quick start
-----------

1. Edit /etc/wireguard/wireguard-go-transport.json
   (loginPluginSecret must match on both ends).
2. Copy and edit the interface config:
     cp /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf.example /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf
     chmod 600 /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf
3. Start in foreground:
     sudo LOG_LEVEL=verbose /usr/bin/wireguard-go -f wg0

Binary path: /usr/bin/wireguard-go
Config dir:  /etc/wireguard/
